t-white"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/25 backdrop-blur-sm"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg></span><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/25 backdrop-blur-sm"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path></svg></span><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/25 backdrop-blur-sm"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle><line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"></line><line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"></line></svg></span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-4 bottom-5 pr-12"><div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full bg-white/40"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-20 rounded-full bg-white/40"></span></div><span class="mb-2 block h-2.5 w-full rounded-full bg-white/30"></span><span class="block h-2.5 w-2/3 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span></div></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1 bg-white/20"><div class="h-full bg-white transition-[width] duration-700 w-1/4"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-ink-wash"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20"><h2 class="max-w-2xl font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[40px]">How to Download YouTube Shorts with YouTube Shorts Downloader</h2><ol class="mt-12 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-8"><li class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><span class="font-display text-6xl font-extrabold leading-none text-brand-500" style="font-variation-settings:&#x27;wdth&#x27; 80, &#x27;opsz&#x27; 96" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-ink shadow-sm ring-1 ring-ink-line"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg></span><span class="hidden h-px flex-1 bg-ink-line md:block" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Find the YouTube Short you want to download. Tap the share button on mobile or copy the URL from your browser&#x27;s address bar on desktop. Any valid YouTube Shorts link will work.</p></li><li class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><span class="font-display text-6xl font-extrabold leading-none text-brand-500" style="font-variation-settings:&#x27;wdth&#x27; 80, &#x27;opsz&#x27; 96" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-ink shadow-sm ring-1 ring-ink-line"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="4" rx="1" ry="1"></rect></svg></span><span class="hidden h-px flex-1 bg-ink-line md:block" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Paste the copied URL into the input field above and click the Download button. YouTube Shorts Downloader will analyze the video and retrieve all available quality and format options for you.</p></li><li class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><span class="font-display text-6xl font-extrabold leading-none text-brand-500" style="font-variation-settings:&#x27;wdth&#x27; 80, &#x27;opsz&#x27; 96" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-ink shadow-sm ring-1 ring-ink-line"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg></span></div><p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Browse the available quality tiers — from 360p to 1080p — and select the resolution that fits your needs. Click your chosen option to save the MP4 file directly to your device.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24"><div class="max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[40px]">The Most Comprehensive YouTube Shorts Download Tool Available</h2><p class="prose-copy mt-5">YouTube Shorts Downloader was built to be the only Shorts downloader you ever need. It combines multiple format options, flexible quality selection, batch-friendly workflows, and universal device compatibility into a single, clean interface. Our backend infrastructure is continuously updated to stay compatible with YouTube&#x27;s latest changes, and our multi-server architecture ensures fast processing regardless of traffic volume. From casual users saving a single Short to power users downloading dozens of videos, YouTube Shorts Downloader scales to meet every need.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-x-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="border-t border-ink-line py-7"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Multiple Quality Options</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Choose from 360p, 480p, 720p, or 1080p Full HD. YouTube Shorts Downloader presents every available quality tier so you can pick the resolution that matches your needs perfectly.</p></div><div class="border-t border-ink-line py-7"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">All-in-One Download Hub</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Everything you need in a single tool. YouTube Shorts Downloader combines format selection, quality control, and fast processing into one streamlined interface — no need to juggle multiple downloaders.</p></div><div class="border-t border-ink-line py-7"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="17 1 21 5 17 9"></polyline><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"></path><polyline points="7 23 3 19 7 15"></polyline><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Batch-Friendly Workflow</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Download Shorts one after another with zero restrictions. No cooldown timers, no daily caps, and no throttling. YouTube Shorts Downloader is built for users who need to save multiple videos efficiently.</p></div><div class="border-t border-ink-line py-7"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 12 20 22 4 22 4 12"></polyline><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="5"></rect><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="7"></line><path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7z"></path><path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">100% Free, No Limits</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Every feature in YouTube Shorts Downloader is available at no cost. There are no premium tiers, no trial periods, and no feature gates. Full functionality for every user, every time.</p></div><div class="border-t border-ink-line py-7"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="2.18" ry="2.18"></rect><line x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="22"></line><line x1="17" y1="2" x2="17" y2="22"></line><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line><line x1="2" y1="7" x2="7" y2="7"></line><line x1="2" y1="17" x2="7" y2="17"></line><line x1="17" y1="17" x2="22" y2="17"></line><line x1="17" y1="7" x2="22" y2="7"></line></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Universal MP4 Format</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">All downloads are delivered as clean MP4 files compatible with every device and platform. Play them anywhere, edit them in any software, or upload them to any social network.</p></div><div class="border-t border-ink-line py-7"><span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M15 7h3a5 5 0 0 1 5 5 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-3m-6 0H6a5 5 0 0 1-5-5 5 5 0 0 1 5-5h3"></path><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Comprehensive URL Support</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">YouTube Shorts Downloader recognizes every YouTube Shorts URL format — youtube.com/shorts/, youtu.be/ links, app share links, and more. Paste any valid link and it just works.</p></div></div></section><section class="border-y border-ink-line bg-ink-wash"><div class="mx-